{"id":"626b9ea69e281e07","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation.md","title":"原始递归序数记号系统","display":"df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation — 原始递归序数记号系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation","aliases":["18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation","18-df-6.1-1"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation — 原始递归序数记号系统","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal-notation]]","[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§§3.3.1, 3.4.3 (local abstract interface; legacy filename is not a source number)","source_pages":"33–34, 41","source_pdf_pages":"43–44, 51","verification_status":"local-definition-source-compatible","patch_revision":"2026-10-14","patch_verification_status":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked","patch_review_scope":"明确记号域与序关系特征函数的输入类型；保留两者均须本原递归的原条件及旧谓词别名。","patch_source_review":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation</span><span>18-df-6.1-1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation — 原始递归序数记号系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dbee0f67d1223ea0\" href=\"?note=dbee0f67d1223ea0\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-notation\">18-df-ordinal-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§§3.3.1, 3.4.3 (local abstract interface; legacy filename is not a source number)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"33–34, 41"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"43–44, 51"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-source-compatible"},{"key":"patch_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"patch_verification_status","html":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"patch_review_scope","html":"明确记号域与序关系特征函数的输入类型；保留两者均须本原递归的原条件及旧谓词别名。"},{"key":"patch_source_review","html":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq T^2\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:T\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(v:T\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbee0f67d1223ea0\" href=\"?note=dbee0f67d1223ea0\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-notation\">18-df-ordinal-notation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_k\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元原始递归函数族；关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\prec\">\\(T,\\prec\\)</span> 的全域特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T,\\chi_{\\prec}\">\\(\\chi_T,\\chi_{\\prec}\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lift}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Lift}_1\\)</span> 取同一函数项节点的显式输入转换。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursiveOrdinalNotation}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursiveOrdinalNotation}\\)</span> 均由下式定义为同一三元谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_{\\prec}:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_T:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_{\\prec}:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;t\\in T,\\\\0&amp;t\\notin T,\\end{cases}\\qquad(t&lt;\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_T(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;t\\in T,\\\\0&amp;t\\notin T,\\end{cases}\\qquad(t&lt;\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{\\prec}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec,\\\\0&amp;\\langle s,t\\rangle\\notin\\prec,\\end{cases}\\qquad(s,t&lt;\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_{\\prec}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec,\\\\0&amp;\\langle s,t\\rangle\\notin\\prec,\\end{cases}\\qquad(s,t&lt;\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\land \\operatorname{Lift}_1(\\chi_T)\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1\\land\\chi_{\\prec}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\land \\operatorname{Lift}_1(\\chi_T)\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1\\land\\chi_{\\prec}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 RecursiveOrdinalNotation 旧接口，但其当前精确含义是“原始递归”，不宣称它刻画所有递归记号系统。原稿仅要求序关系的 χ 为 PR，漏检记号域 T。原书 §§3.3.1、3.4.3 分别证明 OT 及比较关系为 PR；并非 Definition 6.1.1（该处是归纳定义的规则集合）。本节点为抽象复用接口，具体 OT 的语法规则仍须另核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"dbee0f67d1223ea0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"dbee0f67d1223ea0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\omega$，$\\prec\\subseteq T^2$，$v:T\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal-notation]]。$\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_k$ 是 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]] 的 $k$ 元原始递归函数族；关系 $T,\\prec$ 的全域特征函数 $\\chi_T,\\chi_{\\prec}$ 由下式定义；$\\operatorname{Lift}_1$ 取同一函数项节点的显式输入转换。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\omega$，$\\prec\\subseteq T^2$，$v:T\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal-notation]]。$\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_k$ 是 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]] 的 $k$ 元原始递归函数族；关系 $T,\\prec$ 的全域特征函数 $\\chi_T,\\chi_{\\prec}$ 由下式定义；$\\operatorname{Lift}_1$ 取同一函数项节点的显式输入转换。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"v:T\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_T,\\chi_{\\prec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lift}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursiveOrdinalNotation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_T:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_{\\prec}:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_T(t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&t\\in T,\\\\0&t\\notin T,\\end{cases}\\qquad(t<\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_{\\prec}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\prec,\\\\0&\\langle s,t\\rangle\\notin\\prec,\\end{cases}\\qquad(s,t<\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{OrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\land \\operatorname{Lift}_1(\\chi_T)\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1\\land\\chi_{\\prec}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{RecursiveOrdinalNotation}(T,\\prec,v).","display":true}],"bytes":2661,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation]]"},{"id":"dbee0f67d1223ea0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地支撑定义。加入赋值单射条件，排除不同代码被压成同一序数而仍被误称为严格记号序。有效性要求另见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation]]；这里只定义忠实序嵌入，不从一个赋值函数自动推出代码集和比较关系可计算。原书 §3.3.1 和 §3.4.3 提供具体记号系统。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-primitive-recursive-ordinal-notation]]"}],"outgoing":["dbee0f67d1223ea0","f04544345afa1f92"]}